    "shortDescription": "<div class=\"pricingsection\">\n\n<div class=\"divclom9\">\n\n<div class=\"pricetable\">\n\n<table class=\"price_chart\">\n\n<tbody>\n\n<tr>\n\n<th class=\"bold\">Item</th>\n\n<th>100-299</th>\n\n<th>300-499</th>\n\n<th>500-999</th>\n\n<th>1000-2999</th>\n\n<th>3000</th>\n\n<th>Code</th>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td class=\"bold\"></td>\n\n<td>$2.900</td>\n\n<td>$2.500</td>\n\n<td>$2.300</td>\n\n<td>$2.150</td>\n\n<td>$1.950</td>\n\n<td>(5C)</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody>\n\n</table>\n\n<div class=\"priceNOte\">Pricing is per bag with 1 Color / 1 Side - Screen Print. - Insert Included.\n\nSee IMPRINT DETAILS for set-up charges.\n\nPrices are subject to change due to fluctuating tariffs.\n\n<strong> Production is 5 business days after all credit and art approvals.</strong>\n\n**Total impressions over 3000 will require additional production time.**</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"tabs\">\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Description</h4>\n\n<span class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">Bag new business with our Y2K grocery bag! Measuring 13\" x 14\", this heavy duty bag features 7\" gussets and is made from durable, 100 GSM non-woven polypropylene. Crafted with 22\" reinforced sewn handles, a hemmed opening, and stitched seams in the sides and bottom gusset. Includes a poly board insert for extra strength. This bag is the ideal size for that quick stop at the grocery store on your way home from work. Sturdy and roomy and most importantly, reusable!</span>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Product Details</h4>\n\n<div class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nMaterial: </label><div class=\"span-text\"><span>100 GSM Non-woven polypropylene - Recyclable # 5.</span></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nSize: </label><div class=\"span-text\"><span>13\" W x 7\" Gussets x 14\" H</span></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nHandle Style: </label><div class=\"span-text\"><span>22\" matching non-woven</span></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nExtras: </label><div class=\"span-text\"><span>Poly Board Inserts Included</span></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCase Pack: </label><div class=\"span-text\"><span>100</span></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCase Weight: </label><div class=\"span-text\"><span>20 lbs</span></div></div>\t\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nAvailable Colors: </label><div class=\"span-text\"><span>Purple, Kelly Green, Hunter Green, Tan, Red, Royal Blue, Black, Lime Green, Yellow, Navy Blue, Maui Blue, Teal</span></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nMaterial Thickness: </label><div class=\"span-text\"><span>100 GSM (grams per square meter)</span></div></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Imprint Details</h4>\n\n<div class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nPrint Location Options: </label><div class=\"span-text\"><span>Front, Back, Gusset 1, Gusset 2</span></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nAdditional Run Charges For Front Or Back: </label><div class=\"span-text\"><span>1st color/1st location Run charge - FREE.\n\nRun charge: $0.60 (C) per add'l color/location.\n\nUp to 4 spot colors per side.</span></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nMax Artwork Size: </label><div class=\"span-text\"><span>8\" W x 8\" H</span></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nAdditional Run Charges For Gusset: </label><div class=\"span-text\"><span>$0.60 (C) per gusset.\n\nMaximum 1 spot color per gusset.</span></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nMax Gusset Artwork Size: </label><div class=\"span-text\"><span>4\" W x 7\" H</span></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nProduction Time: </label><div class=\"span-text\"><strong>5 working days.</strong><span>Production begins after all credit and art proof approvals have been completed.\n\n**Orders with more than 3000 total impressions will require additional production time.**</span></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nSet-up Charge: </label><div class=\"span-text\"><span>$60.00 (G) per color, location, bag size and/or design.\n\nReorders $40.00 (G) per color, location, bag size and/or design.</span></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nSpecial Requests: </label><div class=\"span-text\"><span>PMS Matching - $90 (E) per color\n\nCall to confirm color availability</span></div></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Shipping Details</h4>\n\n<div class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nUnits Per Carton: </label><div class=\"span-text\"><span>100</span></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCarton Weight (Lbs): </label><div class=\"span-text\"><span>20</span></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCarton Length: </label><div class=\"span-text\"><span>16</span></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCarton Height: </label><div class=\"span-text\"><span>21</span></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCarton Width: </label><div class=\"span-text\"><span>15</span></div></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>",
