    "shortDescription": "<div class=\"pricingsection\">\n\n<div class=\"divclom9\">\n\n<div class=\"pricetable\">\n\n<table class=\"price_chart\">\n\n<tbody>\n\n<tr>\n\n<th class=\"bold\">Item #</th>\n\n<th>100-299</th>\n\n<th>300-499</th>\n\n<th>500-999</th>\n\n<th>1000-2999</th>\n\n<th>3000</th>\n\n<th>Code</th>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td class=\"bold\"></td>\n\n<td>$4.800</td>\n\n<td>$3.650</td>\n\n<td>$3.500</td>\n\n<td>$3.150</td>\n\n<td>$2.950</td>\n\n<td>(5C)</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody>\n\n</table>\n\n<div class=\"priceNOte\">Pricing is per bag with Full Color / 1 Side - Color Evolution. - Insert Included.\n\nFREE Set-up.\n\nPrices are subject to change due to fluctuating tariffs.\n\n<strong> Production is 10 business days after all credit and art approvals.</strong>\n\n**Total impressions over 3000 will require additional production time.**</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"tabs\">\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Description</h4>\n\n<span class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">Bag new business with our Y2K grocery bag! Measuring 12\" x 13\", this heavy duty bag features 8\" gussets and is made from durable, 100 GSM non-woven polypropylene. Made with a hemmed opening, a convenient hanging loop, and 22\" reinforced sewn handles that extend down the height of the bag. Includes a poly board insert for superior strength.</span>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Product Details</h4>\n\n<div class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nMaterial: </label><div class=\"span-text\">100 GSM Non-woven polypropylene - Recyclable # 5.</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nSize: </label><div class=\"span-text\">12\" W x 8\" Gussets x 13\" H</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nHandle Style: </label><div class=\"span-text\">22\" matching non-woven</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nExtras: </label><div class=\"span-text\">Poly Board Inserts Included</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCase Pack: </label><div class=\"span-text\">100</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCase Weight: </label><div class=\"span-text\">22 lbs</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nAvailable Colors: </label><div class=\"span-text\">Kelly Green, Hunter Green, Tan, Royal Blue, Red, Black, Lime Green, Orange, Navy Blue, White, Chocolate Brown, Burgundy Red, Maui Blue, Purple, Gray, Teal Green, Bright Pink, Yellow</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nMaterial Thickness: </label><div class=\"span-text\">100 GSM (grams per square meter)</div></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Imprint Details</h4>\n\n<div class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nMax Artwork Size: </label><div class=\"span-text\">5\" W x 8\" H</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nMax Gusset Artwork Size: </label><div class=\"span-text\">4\" W x 7\" H</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nProduction Time: </label><div class=\"span-text\"><strong>10 working days.</strong>Production begins after all credit and art proof approvals have been completed.\n\n**Orders with more than 3000 total impressions will require additional production time.**</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nPrint Location Options: </label><div class=\"span-text\">Front, Back, Gusset 1, Gusset 2</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nSet-up Charge: </label><div class=\"span-text\">FREE Set-Up for Color Evolution</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nAdditional Run Charges For Front Or Back: </label><div class=\"span-text\">Back Side Imprint add $1.50 (C) per bag</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nAdditional Run Charges For Gusset: </label><div class=\"span-text\">$1.50 (C) per gusset</div></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Shipping Details</h4>\n\n<div class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCarton Weight (Lbs): </label><div class=\"span-text\">22</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCarton Width: </label><div class=\"span-text\">14</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCarton Height: </label><div class=\"span-text\">24</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCarton Length: </label><div class=\"span-text\">15</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nUnits Per Carton: </label><div class=\"span-text\">100</div></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>",
    "description": "<div class=\"buttons\">\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li><i class=\"fas fa-play\"></i><a id=\"rq-popup-btn\" href=\"#\">Request Quote</a></li>\n\n \t<li><i class=\"fas fa-play\"></i><a id=\"os-popup-btn\" href=\"#\">Order Sample</a></li>\n\n</ul>\n\n</div>",
