    "shortDescription": "<div class=\"pricingsection\">\n\n<div class=\"divclom9\">\n\n<div class=\"pricetable\">\n\n<table class=\"price_chart\">\n\n<tbody>\n\n<tr>\n\n<th class=\"bold\">Item #</th>\n\n<th>100-299</th>\n\n<th>300-499</th>\n\n<th>500-999</th>\n\n<th>1000-2999</th>\n\n<th>3000</th>\n\n<th>Code</th>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td class=\"bold\"></td>\n\n<td>$2.700</td>\n\n<td>$2.350</td>\n\n<td>$2.050</td>\n\n<td>$1.950</td>\n\n<td>$1.800</td>\n\n<td>(5C)</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody>\n\n</table>\n\n<div class=\"priceNOte\">Pricing is per bag with 1 Color / 1 Side - Screen Print. - Insert Included.\n\nSee IMPRINT DETAILS for set-up charges.\n\nPrices are subject to change due to fluctuating tariffs.\n\n<strong> Production is 5 business days after all credit and art approvals.</strong>\n\n**Total impressions over 3000 will require additional production time.**</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"tabs\">\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Description</h4>\n\n<span class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">Bag new business with our Recession Buster grocery bag! Measuring 12\" x 13\", this knockout bag features 8\" gussets and is made from durable, 80 GSM non-woven polypropylene. Crafted with 22\" reinforced sewn handles, a hemmed opening, and stitched seams in the sides and bottom gusset. Includes a poly board insert made of recycled plastic for extra strength.</span>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Product Details</h4>\n\n<div class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nMaterial: </label><div class=\"span-text\">80 GSM Non-woven polypropylene - Recyclable # 5.</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nSize: </label><div class=\"span-text\">12\" W x 8\" Gussets x 13\" H</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nHandle Style: </label><div class=\"span-text\">22\" matching non-woven</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nExtras: </label><div class=\"span-text\">Poly Board Inserts Included</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCase Pack: </label><div class=\"span-text\">100</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCase Weight: </label><div class=\"span-text\">18 lbs</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nAvailable Colors: </label><div class=\"span-text\">Black, Hunter Green, Navy Blue, Royal Blue, Burgundy, Lime Green, Purple, Red, Tan</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nMaterial Thickness: </label><div class=\"span-text\">80 GSM (grams per square meter)</div></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Imprint Details</h4>\n\n<div class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nMax Artwork Size: </label><div class=\"span-text\">5\" W x 8\" H</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nMax Gusset Artwork Size: </label><div class=\"span-text\">4\" W x 7\" H</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nProduction Time: </label><div class=\"span-text\"><strong>5 working days.</strong> Production begins after all credit and art proof approvals have been completed.\n\n**Orders with more than 3000 total impressions will require additional production time.**</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nPrint Location Options: </label><div class=\"span-text\">Front, Back, Gusset 1, Gusset 2</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nSet-up Charge: </label><div class=\"span-text\">$60.00 (G) per color, location, bag size and/or design.\n\nReorders $40.00 (G) per color, location, bag size and/or design.</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nAdditional Run Charges For Front Or Back: </label><div class=\"span-text\">1st color/1st location Run charge - FREE.\n\nRun charge: $0.60 (C) per add'l color/location.\n\nUp to 4 spot colors per side.</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nAdditional Run Charges For Gusset: </label><div class=\"span-text\">$0.60 (C) per gusset.\n\nMaximum 1 spot color per gusset.</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nSpecial Requests: </label><div class=\"span-text\">PMS Matching - $90 (E) per color\n\nCall to confirm color availability</div></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Shipping Details</h4>\n\n<div class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCarton Weight (Lbs): </label><div class=\"span-text\">18</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCarton Width: </label><div class=\"span-text\">14</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCarton Height: </label><div class=\"span-text\">22</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCarton Length: </label><div class=\"span-text\">15</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nUnits Per Carton: </label><div class=\"span-text\">100</div></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>",
