    "shortDescription": "<div class=\"pricingsection\">\n\n  <div class=\"divclom9\">\n\n    <div class=\"pricetable\">\n\n      <table class=\"price_chart\">\n\n        <tbody>\n\n          <tr>\n\n            <th class=\"bold\">Item#</th>\n\n            <th>100-299 </th>\n\n            <th>300-499 </th>\n\n            <th>500-999 </th>\n\n            <th>1000-2999 </th>\n\n            <th>3000 </th>\n\n            <th>Code</th>\n\n          </tr>\n\n          <tr>\n\n            <td class=\"bold\">\n\n              <span>\n\n                <span></span>\n\n              </span>\n\n            </td>\n\n            <td>\n\n              <span>\n\n                <span>$4.600</span>\n\n              </span>\n\n            </td>\n\n            <td>\n\n              <span>\n\n                <span>$3.550</span>\n\n              </span>\n\n            </td>\n\n            <td>\n\n              <span>\n\n                <span>$3.250</span>\n\n              </span>\n\n            </td>\n\n            <td>\n\n              <span>\n\n                <span>$2.950</span>\n\n              </span>\n\n            </td>\n\n            <td>\n\n              <span>\n\n                <span>$2.800</span>\n\n              </span>\n\n            </td>\n\n            <td>\n\n              <span>\n\n                <span>(5C)</span>\n\n              </span>\n\n            </td>\n\n          </tr>\n\n        </tbody>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <div class=\"priceNOte\"> Pricing is per bag with Full Color / 1 Side - Color Evolution. - Insert Included. <br>FREE Set-up. <br>Prices are subject to change due to fluctuating tariffs. <br>\n\n        <strong> Production is 10 business days after all credit and art approvals.</strong>\n\n        <br>**Total impressions over 3000 will require additional production time.**\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"tabs\">\n\n  <div class=\"content-box\">\n\n    <h4 class=\"content-head\">Description</h4>\n\n    <span class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">Bag new business with our Recession Buster grocery bag! Measuring 12” x 13”, this knockout bag features 8” gussets and is made from durable, 80 GSM non-woven polypropylene&nbsp; Crafted with 22” reinforced sewn handles, a hemmed opening, and stitched seams in the sides and bottom gusset. Includes a poly board insert made of recycled plastic for extra strength. Customized with our Color Evolution 4-color process, which is perfect for multi-color designs and photographs.< </span>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content-box\">\n\n    <h4 class=\"content-head\">Product Details</h4>\n\n    <div class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Material: </label><div class=\"span-text\">\n\n        <span>80 GSM Non-woven polypropylene - Recyclable # 5.</span></div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Size: </label><div class=\"span-text\">\n\n        <span>12\" W x 8\" Gussets x 13\" H</span></div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Handle Style: </label><div class=\"span-text\">\n\n        <span>22\" matching non-woven</span></div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Extras: </label><div class=\"span-text\">\n\n        <span>Poly Board Inserts Included</span></div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Case Pack: </label><div class=\"span-text\">\n\n        <span>100</span></div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Case Weight: </label><div class=\"span-text\">\n\n        <span>18 lbs</span></div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Available Colors: </label><div class=\"span-text\">\n\n        <span>Black, Hunter Green, Navy Blue, Royal Blue, Burgundy Red, Lime Green, Purple, Red, Tan</span></div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Material Thickness: </label><div class=\"span-text\">\n\n        <span>80 GSM (grams per square meter)</span></div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content-box\">\n\n    <h4 class=\"content-head\">Imprint Details</h4>\n\n    <div class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Max Artwork Size: </label><div class=\"span-text\">\n\n        <span>5\" W x 8\" H</span></div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Max Gusset Artwork Size: </label><div class=\"span-text\">\n\n        <span>4\" W x 7\" H</span></div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Production Time: </label><div class=\"span-text\">\n\n        <span>\n\n          <strong>10 working days.</strong> Production begins after all credit and art proof approvals have been completed. <br>**Orders with more than 3000 total impressions will require additional production time.** </span></div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Print Location Options: </label><div class=\"span-text\">\n\n        <span>Front, Back, Gusset 1, Gusset 2</span></div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Set-up Charge: </label><div class=\"span-text\">\n\n        <span>FREE Set-Up for Color Evolution </span></div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Additional Run Charges For Front Or Back: </label><div class=\"span-text\">\n\n        <span>Back Side Imprint add $1.50 (C) per bag</span></div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Additional Run Charges For Gusset: </label><div class=\"span-text\">\n\n        <span>$1.50 (C) per gusset</span></div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content-box\">\n\n    <h4 class=\"content-head\">Shipping Details</h4>\n\n    <div class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Carton Weight (Lbs): </label><div class=\"span-text\">\n\n        <span>18</span></div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Carton Width: </label><div class=\"span-text\">\n\n        <span>14</span></div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Carton Height: </label><div class=\"span-text\">\n\n        <span>22</span></div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Carton Length: </label><div class=\"span-text\">\n\n        <span>15</span></div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Units Per Carton: </label><div class=\"span-text\">\n\n        <span>100</span></div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</div>",
