    "shortDescription": "<div class=\"pricingsection\">\n\n<div class=\"divclom9\">\n\n<div class=\"pricetable\">\n\n<table class=\"price_chart\">\n\n<tbody>\n\n<tr>\n\n<th class=\"bold\">Item#</th>\n\n<th>100-299</th>\n\n<th>300-499</th>\n\n<th>500-999</th>\n\n<th>1000-2999</th>\n\n<th>3000</th>\n\n<th>Code</th>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td class=\"bold\"></td>\n\n<td>$3.200</td>\n\n<td>$2.900</td>\n\n<td>$2.700</td>\n\n<td>$2.600</td>\n\n<td>$2.500</td>\n\n<td>(5C)</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody>\n\n</table>\n\n<div class=\"priceNOte\">Pricing is per bag with 1 Color / 1 Side - Screen Print. - Insert Included. See IMPRINT DETAILS for set-up charges. Prices are subject to change due to fluctuating tariffs. <strong> Production is 5 business days after all credit and art approvals.</strong>**Total impressions over 3000 will require additional production time.**</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"tabs\">\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Description</h4>\n\n<span class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">This durable grocery bag measures 13\" x 15\" and features 10\" gussets with 22\" handles. Constructed out of a non-woven, laminated polypropylene material that is easy to wipe clean while providing additional structure and strength. Designed to resist water, tears, and UV rays. Includes a poly board insert and a high-gloss finish for a fashion-forward style. This bag may be customized with a company name and logo.</span>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Product Details</h4>\n\n<div class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Material: </label>\n\n<div class=\"span-text\">110 GSM Non-woven polypropylene with gloss lamination - Recyclable # 5.</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Size: </label>\n\n<div class=\"span-text\">13\" W x 10” Gussets x 15\" H</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Handle Style: </label>\n\n<div class=\"span-text\">22\" matching non-woven</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Extras: </label>\n\n<div class=\"span-text\">Poly Board Inserts Included</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Case Pack: </label>\n\n<div class=\"span-text\">100</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Case Weight: </label>\n\n<div class=\"span-text\">25 lbs</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Available Colors: </label>\n\n<div class=\"span-text\">White, Lime Green, Royal Blue, Navy Blue, Black, Purple</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Material Thickness: </label>\n\n<div class=\"span-text\">110 GSM (grams per square meter)</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Imprint Details</h4>\n\n<div class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Max Artwork Size: </label>\n\n<div class=\"span-text\">8” W x 8” H</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Max Gusset Artwork Size: </label>\n\n<div class=\"span-text\">4\" W x 7\" H</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Production Time: </label>\n\n<div class=\"span-text\"><strong>5 working days.</strong> Production begins after all credit and art proof approvals have been completed. **Orders with more than 3000 total impressions will require additional production time.**</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Print Location Options: </label>\n\n<div class=\"span-text\">Front, Back, Gusset 1, Gusset 2</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Set-up Charge: </label>\n\n<div class=\"span-text\">$60.00 (G) per color, location, bag size and/or design. Reorders $40.00 (G) per color, location, bag size and/or design.</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Additional Run Charges For Front Or Back: </label>\n\n<div class=\"span-text\">1st color/1st location Run charge - FREE. Run charge: $0.60 (C) per additional color/location. Up to 2 spot colors per side.</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Additional Run Charges For Gusset: </label>\n\n<div class=\"span-text\">$0.60 (C) per gusset. Maximum 1 spot color per gusset.</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Special Requests: </label>\n\n<div class=\"span-text\">PMS Matching - $90 (E) per color Call to confirm color availability</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Shipping Details</h4>\n\n<div class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Carton Weight (Lbs): </label>\n\n<div class=\"span-text\">25</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Carton Width: </label>\n\n<div class=\"span-text\">15</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Carton Height: </label>\n\n<div class=\"span-text\">17</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Carton Length: </label>\n\n<div class=\"span-text\">18</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Units Per Carton: </label>\n\n<div class=\"span-text\">100</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>",
