    "shortDescription": "<table class=\"product-price-table\">\n\n<thead>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Item #</td>\n\n<td>100-299</td>\n\n<td>300-499</td>\n\n<td>500-999</td>\n\n<td>1000-2999</td>\n\n<td>3000</td>\n\n<td>Code</td>\n\n<td><span class=\"bold\">USD$</span>\n\n<img id=\"currency-flag\" src=\"https://areusablebag.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/US_square.png\" alt=\"US Pricing\" /></td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</thead>\n\n<tbody>\n\n<tr class=\"pricing-row\">\n\n<td class=\"price-catalog-id\">Y2KC1213</td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$ <span data-qty=\"150\" data-price=\"5.60\">6.000</span></td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$ <span data-qty=\"250\" data-price=\"5.05\">4.900</span></td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$ <span data-qty=\"500\" data-price=\"4.95\">4.750</span></td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$ <span data-qty=\"1000\" data-price=\"4.85\">4.400</span></td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$ <span data-qty=\"3000\" data-price=\"4.75\">4.200</span></td>\n\n<td>(5C)</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody>\n\n</table>\n\nPricing is per bag with Full Color / 1 Side - Color Evolution. - Insert Included.\n\nFREE Set-up.\n\nPrices are subject to change due to fluctuating tariffs.\n\nProduction is 10 business days after all credit and art approvals.\n\n**Total impressions over 3000 will require additional production time.**\n\n<div class=\"tabs\">\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Description</h4>\n\n<span class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">The ultimate lunch bag! Maintain food temperature and support the environment all at once! Our insulated lunch bag measures 8\"W x 12\"H with 7\" gussets and 18\" handles. Made from non-woven polypropylene material with an insulated polyester fiber and coated thermal film interior. Keeps food hot or cold for hours! Say goodbye to brown paper lunch bags forever! Features a poly board insert and Hook and Loop strips for closure for a firm seal and a side pocket perfect for your beverage bottle. Customized with Color Evolution!</span>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Product Details</h4>\n\n<div class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Material: </label><div class=\"span-text\">238 GSM Non-woven polypropylene with thermal lining made from polyester fiber and coated thermal film</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Size: </label><div class=\"span-text\">8\" W x 7\" Gussets x 12\" H</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Handle Style: </label><div class=\"span-text\">18\" matching strap handle</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Extras: </label><div class=\"span-text\">Poly Board Inserts Included</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Case Pack: </label><div class=\"span-text\">100</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Case Weight: </label><div class=\"span-text\">23 lbs</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Available Colors: </label><div class=\"span-text\">Teal, Purple, Royal Blue, Red, Lime Green, Navy Blue, Black, Tan, Hunter Green</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Material Thickness: </label><div class=\"span-text\">238 GSM (grams per square meter)</div></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Imprint Details</h4>\n\n<div class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Max Artwork Size: </label><div class=\"span-text\">5\" W x 7\" H</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Production Time: </label><div class=\"span-text\">\n\n<strong>10 working days.</strong>Production begins after all credit and art proof approvals have been completed.\n\n**Orders with more than 3000 total impressions will require additional production time.**</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Print Location Options: </label><div class=\"span-text\">Front, Back</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Set-up Charge: </label><div class=\"span-text\">FREE Set-Up for Color Evolution</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Additional Run Charges For Front Or Back: </label><div class=\"span-text\">Back Side Imprint add $1.50 (C) per bag</div></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Shipping Details</h4>\n\n<div class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Carton Weight (Lbs): </label><div class=\"span-text\">23</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Carton Width: </label><div class=\"span-text\">15</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Carton Height: </label><div class=\"span-text\">26</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Carton Length: </label><div class=\"span-text\">18</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Units Per Carton: </label><div class=\"span-text\">100</div></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>",
