    "shortDescription": "<table class=\"product-price-table\"><caption><img class=\"imprint-image\" src=\"https://areusablebag.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/sparkle_imprint_icon.png\" /></caption>\n\n<thead></thead>\n\n<thead>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Item #</td>\n\n<td>150</td>\n\n<td>250</td>\n\n<td>500</td>\n\n<td>1000</td>\n\n<td>3000</td>\n\n<td><span class=\"bold\">USD$</span>\n\n<img id=\"currency-flag\" src=\"https://areusablebag.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/US_square.png\" alt=\"US Pricing\" /></td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</thead>\n\n<tbody>\n\n<tr class=\"pricing-row\">\n\n<td class=\"price-catalog-id\">SPB1315</td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$5<span data-qty=\"150\" data-price=\"3.40\">.55</span></td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$5<span data-qty=\"250\" data-price=\"2.85\">.00</span></td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$4<span data-qty=\"500\" data-price=\"2.75\">.85</span></td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$4<span data-qty=\"1000\" data-price=\"2.65\">.70</span></td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$4<span data-qty=\"3000\" data-price=\"2.55\">.45</span></td>\n\n<td>C</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody>\n\n</table>\n\nColumn price is per item, and includes a 1 color/1 side screen imprint. Screen charges are additional.",
    "description": "<p>[vc_section el_class=\"pro-1\"][vc_row el_class=\"row-2\"][vc_column][vc_column_text]</p>\n\n<div class=\"buttons\">\n\n<ul>\n\n<li><i class=\"fas fa-play\"></i><a id=\"rq-popup-btn\" href=\"#\">Request Quote</a></li>\n\n<li><i class=\"fas fa-play\"></i><a id=\"os-popup-btn\" href=\"#\">Order Sample</a></li>\n\n</ul>\n\n</div>\n\n<p>[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text]</p>\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">The original grocery totes - often imitated, never matched. Our Thunder Totes offer unsurpassed quality, durability, and flexibility. This 100 GSM premium non-woven polypropylene tote features dual reinforced 20\" handles and plastic bottom insert.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-imprints\"></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<p>[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text]</p>\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Also Available With These Imprints</h3>\n\n<p>[/vc_column_text][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/6\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/6\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/6\"][vc_single_image image=\"1024\" alignment=\"center\" el_class=\"img-1\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/6\"][vc_single_image image=\"1048\" alignment=\"center\" el_class=\"img-3\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/6\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/6\"][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row disable_element=\"yes\" el_class=\"row-1\"][vc_column][vc_btn title=\"Freight Estimator\" el_class=\"btn-1\"][vc_btn title=\"Catalog Page\" el_class=\"btn-1\"][vc_btn title=\"Art Specs\" el_class=\"btn-1\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column width=\"1/2\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Imprint Areas\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\"][vc_column_text]Side Gusset  6W x 8H</p>\n\n<p>Front and Back  5W x 10H[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/2\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Additional Charges\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\"][vc_column_text]</p>\n\n<table class=\"product-data-table\">\n\n<tbody>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Set-Up</td>\n\n<td>$55.00 per design. Up to 6 colors (G).</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Reorder Set-Up</td>\n\n<td>$35.00 per design. Up to 6 colors (G).</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Additional Location</td>\n\n<td>$2.00 per bag, per location (G).</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Bottom Insert</td>\n\n<td>Included</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody>\n\n</table>\n\n<p>[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column width=\"1/2\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Production Time\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\"][vc_column_text]</p>\n\n<table class=\"product-data-table\">\n\n<tbody>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>New Orders</td>\n\n<td>10 business days after all final approvals</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Reorders</td>\n\n<td>10 business days after all final approvals</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Rush Orders</td>\n\n<td>No rush available on SPARKLE imprinting</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody>\n\n</table>\n\n<p>[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text]<strong>*Note:</strong> Orders with more than 3,000 impressions will require extra production time.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/2\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Shipping Details\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" el_class=\"hme-txt\"][vc_column_text]</p>\n\n<table class=\"product-data-table-last\">\n\n<tbody>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Box Quantity:</td>\n\n<td>100</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Box Weight:</td>\n\n<td>28 lbs</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Box Dimensions:</td>\n\n<td>17W x<br />\n\n28H x<br />\n\n13</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody>\n\n</table>\n\n<p>[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text]Package dimensions are for the quantity and weight outlined above. Other dimensions for broken-box quantities may apply.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][/vc_section]</p>\n\n",
