    "shortDescription": "<table class=\"product-price-table\">\n\n<thead>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Item #</td>\n\n<td>100-299</td>\n\n<td>300-499</td>\n\n<td>500-999</td>\n\n<td>1000-2999</td>\n\n<td>3000</td>\n\n<td>Code</td>\n\n<td><span class=\"bold\">USD$</span>\n\n<img id=\"currency-flag\" src=\"https://areusablebag.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/US_square.png\" alt=\"US Pricing\" /></td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</thead>\n\n<tbody>\n\n<tr class=\"pricing-row\">\n\n<td class=\"price-catalog-id\">YL2532</td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$ 7.300</td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$ 6.400</td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$ 6.100</td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$ 5.700</td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$ 5.400</td>\n\n<td>(5C)</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody>\n\n</table>\n\nPricing is per bag with Full Color / 1 Side - Color Evolution. - Insert Included.\n\nFREE Set-up.\n\nPrices are subject to change due to fluctuating tariffs.\n\nProduction is 10 business days after all credit and art approvals.\n\n**Total impressions over 3000 will require additional production time.**\n\n<div class=\"tabs\">\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Description</h4>\n\n<span class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">Toss away those old plastic laundry baskets! Our heavy duty, 120 GSM non woven polypropylene laundry bag features a 40\" over the shoulder, 1.5\" wide black woven strap for easy transport. Ideal for universities, hospitals and hotels. Customized with our Color Evolution 4-color process, which is perfect for multi-color designs and photographs.</span>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Product Details</h4>\n\n<div class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nMaterial: </label><div class=\"span-text\">120 GSM Non-woven polypropylene - Recyclable # 5.</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nSize: </label><div class=\"span-text\">25\" W x 32\" H / No Gusset</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nHandle Style: </label><div class=\"span-text\">Black 40\" over the shoulder woven strap</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCase Pack: </label><div class=\"span-text\">50</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCase Weight: </label><div class=\"span-text\">22 lbs</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nAvailable Colors: </label><div class=\"span-text\">Red, Royal Blue, Black</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nMaterial Thickness: </label><div class=\"span-text\">120 GSM (grams per square meter)</div></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Imprint Details</h4>\n\n<div class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nMax Artwork Size: </label><div class=\"span-text\">10.5\" W x 14\" H</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nProduction Time: </label><div class=\"span-text\"><strong>10 working days.</strong> Production begins after all credit and art proof approvals have been completed.\n\n**Orders with more than 3000 total impressions will require additional production time.**</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nPrint Location Options: </label><div class=\"span-text\">Front, Back</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nSet-up Charge: </label><div class=\"span-text\">FREE Set-Up for Color Evolution</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nAdditional Run Charges For Front Or Back: </label><div class=\"span-text\">Back Side Imprint add $1.50 (C) per bag</div></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Shipping Details</h4>\n\n<div class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCarton Weight (Lbs): </label><div class=\"span-text\">22</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCarton Width: </label><div class=\"span-text\">26</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCarton Height: </label><div class=\"span-text\">7</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCarton Length: </label><div class=\"span-text\">35</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nUnits Per Carton: </label><div class=\"span-text\">50</div></div>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>",
