    "shortDescription": "<table class=\"product-price-table\">\n\n<thead>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Item #</td>\n\n<td>100-299</td>\n\n<td>300-499</td>\n\n<td>500-999</td>\n\n<td>1000-2999</td>\n\n<td>3000</td>\n\n<td>Code</td>\n\n<td><span class=\"bold\">USD$</span>\n\n<img id=\"currency-flag\" src=\"https://areusablebag.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/US_square.png\" alt=\"US Pricing\" /></td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</thead>\n\n<tbody>\n\n<tr class=\"pricing-row\">\n\n<td class=\"price-catalog-id\">Y2K8510</td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$ 4.200</td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$ 3.000</td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$ 2.850</td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$ 2.600</td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$ 2.450</td>\n\n<td>(5C)</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody>\n\n</table>\n\nPricing is per bag with Full Color / 1 Side - Color Evolution. - Insert Included.\n\nFREE Set-up.\n\nPrices are subject to change due to fluctuating tariffs.\n\nProduction is 10 business days after all credit and art approvals.\n\n**Total impressions over 3000 will require additional production time.**\n\n<div class=\"tabs\">\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Description</h4>\n\n<span class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">Bag new business with our Recession Buster tote bag! Measuring 8” x 10”, this knockout bag features 5” gussets and is constructed out of durable, 80 GSM non-woven polypropylene Crafted with 12” handles and stitched seams in the sides and bottom gusset. Both reusable and recyclable. Customized with our Color Evolution 4-color process, which is perfect for multi-color designs and photographs.</span>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Product Details</h4>\n\n<div class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Material: </label><div class=\"span-text\">80 GSM Non-woven polypropylene - Recyclable # 5.</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Size: </label><div class=\"span-text\">8\" W x 5\" Gussets x 10\" H</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Handle Style: </label><div class=\"span-text\">12\" matching non-woven</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Case Pack: </label><div class=\"span-text\">100</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Case Weight: </label><div class=\"span-text\">7 lbs</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Available Colors: </label><div class=\"span-text\">Lime Green, Red, Yellow, Royal Blue, Orange, Kelly Green, Navy Blue, White, Black, Burgundy Red, Hunter Green, Purple, Tan, Cool Blue, Maui Blue, Bright Pink</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Material Thickness: </label><div class=\"span-text\">80 GSM (grams per square meter)</div></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Imprint Details</h4>\n\n<div class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Max Artwork Size: </label><div class=\"span-text\">6\" W x 6\" H</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Production Time: </label><div class=\"span-text\">\n\n<strong>10 working days.</strong>Production begins after all credit and art proof approvals have been completed.\n\n**Orders with more than 3000 total impressions will require additional production time.**</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Print Location Options: </label><div class=\"span-text\">Front, Back</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Set-up Charge: </label><div class=\"span-text\">FREE Set-Up for Color Evolution</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Additional Run Charges For Front Or Back: </label><div class=\"span-text\">Back Side Imprint add $1.50 (C) per bag</div></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Shipping Details</h4>\n\n<div class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Carton Weight (Lbs): </label><div class=\"span-text\">7</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Carton Width: </label><div class=\"span-text\">11</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Carton Height: </label><div class=\"span-text\">17</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Carton Length: </label><div class=\"span-text\">10</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Units Per Carton: </label><div class=\"span-text\">100</div></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>",
    "description": "<div class=\"buttons\">\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li><i class=\"fas fa-play\"></i><a id=\"rq-popup-btn\" href=\"#\">Request Quote</a></li>\n\n \t<li><i class=\"fas fa-play\"></i><a id=\"os-popup-btn\" href=\"#\">Order Sample</a></li>\n\n</ul>\n\n</div>",
