    "shortDescription": "<table class=\"product-price-table\">\n\n<thead>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Item #</td>\n\n<td>100-299</td>\n\n<td>300-499</td>\n\n<td>500-999</td>\n\n<td>1000-2999</td>\n\n<td>3000</td>\n\n<td>Code</td>\n\n<td><span class=\"bold\">USD$</span>\n\n<img id=\"currency-flag\" src=\"https://areusablebag.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/US_square.png\" alt=\"US Pricing\" /></td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</thead>\n\n<tbody>\n\n<tr class=\"pricing-row\">\n\n<td class=\"price-catalog-id\">Y2KP16612</td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$ 2.900</td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$ 2.350</td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$ 2.150</td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$ 2.050</td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$ 1.950</td>\n\n<td>(5C)</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody>\n\n</table>\n\nPricing is per bag with Full Color / 1 Side - Color Evolution. - Insert Included.\n\nFREE Set-up.\n\nPrices are subject to change due to fluctuating tariffs.\n\nProduction is 10 business days after all credit and art approvals.\n\n**Total impressions over 3000 will require additional production time.**\n\n<div class=\"tabs\">\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Description</h4>\n\n<span class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">Make this Y2K bag an everyday essential! Our non-woven 80 GSM polypropylene tote bag is the perfect day-to-day companion. Each bag measures 16\" x 12\" with 6\" gussets and 28\" handles. Has the look, feel, strength and quality of cloth but is tear resistant and water resistant! Features stitched seams in the side and bottom gussets, single and double side pockets. Poly board inserts are available as an add-on.</span>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Further Description</h4>\n\n<span class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">This bag is available with a poly board insert for the bottom of the bag at an additional cost of $0.70 (C) per bag. The insert is made out of clear plastic. Please order separately and we will slip one in each bag for you. You’ll need to add 8 lbs. per 100 bags to the case weight if ordering inserts.</span>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Product Details</h4>\n\n<div class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nMaterial: </label><div class=\"span-text\">80 GSM Non-woven polypropylene - Recyclable # 5.</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nSize: </label><div class=\"span-text\">16” W x 6” Gussets x 12” H</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nHandle Style: </label><div class=\"span-text\">28\" matching non-woven</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCase Pack: </label><div class=\"span-text\">100</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCase Weight: </label><div class=\"span-text\">17 lbs</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nAvailable Colors: </label><div class=\"span-text\">Lime Green, Yellow, White, Black, Orange, Tan, Navy Blue, Red, Royal Blue, Burgundy, Hunter Green, Purple, Bright Pink, Cool Blue</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nMaterial Thickness: </label><div class=\"span-text\">80 GSM (grams per square meter)</div></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Imprint Details</h4>\n\n<div class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nMax Artwork Size: </label><div class=\"span-text\">10” W x 8” H</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nProduction Time: </label><div class=\"span-text\"><strong>5 working days.</strong> Production begins after all credit and art proof approvals have been completed.\n\n**Orders with more than 3000 total impressions will require additional production time.**</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nPrint Location Options: </label><div class=\"span-text\">Front, Back</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nSet-up Charge: </label><div class=\"span-text\">$60.00 (G) per color, location, bag size and/or design.\n\nReorders $40.00 (G) per color, location, bag size and/or design.</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nAdditional Run Charges For Front Or Back: </label><div class=\"span-text\">1st color/1st location Run charge - FREE.\n\nRun charge: $0.60 (C) per add'l color/location.\n\nUp to 4 spot colors per side.</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nSpecial Requests: </label><div class=\"span-text\">PMS Matching - $90 (E) per color\n\nCall to confirm color availability</div></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Shipping Details</h4>\n\n<div class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCarton Weight (Lbs): </label><div class=\"span-text\">17</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCarton Width: </label><div class=\"span-text\">15</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCarton Height: </label><div class=\"span-text\">14</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCarton Length: </label><div class=\"span-text\">19</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nUnits Per Carton: </label><div class=\"span-text\">100</div></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>",
