    "shortDescription": "<table class=\"product-price-table\">\n\n<thead>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Item #</td>\n\n<td>100-299</td>\n\n<td>300-499</td>\n\n<td>500-999</td>\n\n<td>1000-2999</td>\n\n<td>3000</td>\n\n<td>Code</td>\n\n<td><span class=\"bold\">USD$</span>\n\n<img id=\"currency-flag\" src=\"https://areusablebag.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/US_square.png\" alt=\"US Pricing\" /></td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</thead>\n\n<tbody>\n\n<tr class=\"pricing-row\">\n\n<td class=\"price-catalog-id\">SPRT1620</td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$<span data-qty=\"150\" data-price=\"5.60\">5.000</span></td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$<span data-qty=\"250\" data-price=\"5.05\">3.800</span></td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$<span data-qty=\"500\" data-price=\"4.95\">3.550</span></td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$<span data-qty=\"1000\" data-price=\"4.85\">3.250</span></td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$<span data-qty=\"3000\" data-price=\"4.75\">3.100</span></td>\n\n<td>5C</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody>\n\n</table>\n\nPricing is per bag with 1 Color / 1 Side - Screen Print. - Insert Included.\n\nSee IMPRINT DETAILS for set-up charges.\n\nPrices are subject to change due to fluctuating tariffs.\n\nProduction is 5 business days after all credit and art approvals.\n\n**Total impressions over 3000 will require additional production time.**\n\n<div class=\"tabs\">\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Description</h4>\n\n<span class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">Make this Y2K bag an everyday essential! Our non-woven 80 GSM polypropylene tote bag is the perfect day-to-day companion. Each bag measures 20\" x 16\" with 6\" gussets and 28\" handles. Has the look, feel, strength and quality of cloth but is tear resistant and water repellent! Features stitched seams in the side and bottom gussets, single and double side pockets. Poly board inserts are available as an add-on. Customized with our Color Evolution 4-color process, which is perfect for multi-color designs and photographs.</span>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Further Description</h4>\n\n<span class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">This bag is available with a poly board insert for the bottom of the bag at an additional cost of $0.70 (C) per bag. The insert is made out of clear plastic. Please order separately and we will slip one in each bag for you. You’ll need to add 10 lbs. per 100 bags to the case weight if ordering inserts.</span>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Product Details</h4>\n\n<div class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nMaterial: </label><div class=\"span-text\">80 GSM Non-woven polypropylene - Recyclable # 5.</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nSize: </label><div class=\"span-text\">20\" W x 6” Gussets x 16” H</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nHandle Style: </label><div class=\"span-text\">28\" matching non-woven</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCase Pack: </label><div class=\"span-text\">100</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCase Weight: </label><div class=\"span-text\">22 lbs</div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nAvailable Colors: </label><div class=\"span-text\">Lime Green, Yellow, White, Black, Orange, Tan, Navy Blue, Red, Royal Blue, Burgundy, Hunter Green, Purple, Cool Blue</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nMaterial Thickness: </label><div class=\"span-text\">80 GSM (grams per square meter)</div></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Imprint Details</h4>\n\n<div class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nMax Artwork Size: </label><div class=\"span-text\">12” W x 10” H</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nProduction Time: </label><div class=\"span-text\"><span><strong>10 working days.</strong> Production begins after all credit and art proof approvals have been completed.\n\n**Orders with more than 3000 total impressions will require additional production time.**</span></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nPrint Location Options: </label><div class=\"span-text\">Front, Back</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nSet-up Charge: </label><div class=\"span-text\">FREE Set-Up for Color Evolution</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nAdditional Run Charges For Front Or Back: </label><div class=\"span-text\">Back Side Imprint add $1.50 (C) per bag</div></div>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Shipping Details</h4>\n\n<div class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCarton Weight (Lbs): </label><div class=\"span-text\">22</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCarton Width: </label><div class=\"span-text\">18</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCarton Height: </label><div class=\"span-text\">14</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCarton Length: </label><div class=\"span-text\">22</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nUnits Per Carton: </label><div class=\"span-text\">100</div></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>",
