    "shortDescription": "<table class=\"product-price-table\"><caption><img class=\"imprint-image\" src=\"https://areusablebag.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/screen_imprint_icon-1.png\" /></caption>\n\n<thead></thead>\n\n<thead>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Item #</td>\n\n<td>150</td>\n\n<td>250</td>\n\n<td>500</td>\n\n<td>1000</td>\n\n<td>3000</td>\n\n<td><span class=\"bold\">USD$</span>\n\n<img id=\"currency-flag\" src=\"https://areusablebag.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/US_square.png\" alt=\"US Pricing\" /></td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr class=\"pricing-row\">\n\n<td class=\"price-catalog-id\">SPAC1315</td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$<span data-qty=\"150\" data-price=\"2.95\">2.95</span></td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$<span data-qty=\"250\" data-price=\"2.65\">2.65</span></td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$<span data-qty=\"500\" data-price=\"2.45\">2.45</span></td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$<span data-qty=\"1000\" data-price=\"2.25\">2.25</span></td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$<span data-qty=\"3000\" data-price=\"2.15\">2.15</span></td>\n\n<td>C</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</thead>\n\n</table>\n\nColumn price is per item, and includes a 1 color/1 side screen imprint. Screen charges are additional.",
