    "description": "[vc_section el_class=\"pro-1\"][vc_row el_class=\"row-2\"][vc_column][vc_column_text]\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">This 80 GSM PET non-woven bags features white front and back panels, accented by black gussets, piping, and handles. 1.5\"-wide x 20\"-long handles.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-imprints\"></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text]\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Also Available With These Imprints</h3>\n\n[/vc_column_text][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/6\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/6\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/6\"][vc_single_image image=\"2638\" alignment=\"center\" el_class=\"img-3\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/6\"][vc_single_image image=\"2543\" alignment=\"center\" el_class=\"img-1\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/6\"][vc_single_image image=\"2547\" alignment=\"center\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/6\"][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column width=\"1/2\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Imprint Areas\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\"][vc_column_text]\n\n<table class=\"product-data-table\">\n\n<tbody>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Side Gusset</td>\n\n<td>3W x 6H</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Front and Back</td>\n\n<td>6W x 6H</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody>\n\n</table>\n\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/2\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Additional Charges\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\"][vc_column_text]\n\n<table class=\"product-data-table\">\n\n<tbody>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Set-Up</td>\n\n<td>No Set-Up Charge</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Reorder Set-Up</td>\n\n<td>No Set-Up Charge</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Additional Location</td>\n\n<td>$1.00 per bag, per location (G).</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Additional Color</td>\n\n<td>N/A</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Optional Plastic Bottom Insert</td>\n\n<td>$0.30 per insert (C).</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody>\n\n</table>\n\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column width=\"1/2\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Production Time\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\"][vc_column_text]\n\n<table class=\"product-data-table\">\n\n<tbody>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>New Orders</td>\n\n<td>6 business days after all final approvals</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Reorders</td>\n\n<td>6 business days after all final approvals</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Rush Orders</td>\n\n<td></td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody>\n\n</table>\n\n[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text]<strong>*Note:</strong> Orders with more than 3,000 impressions will require extra production time.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/2\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Imprint Colors\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\"][vc_column_text el_class=\"pro-links-img\"]\n\n<div class=\"imprint-colors\">\n\n\n\n<strong>Please note: Pantone® (PMS) color match is not available.</strong>\n\n\n\nColor tints/shades/tones may fluctuate up to 5% within a print run or reorder. Colors printed on a colored bag will result in a different tint, shade, or tone. Some screen ink colors are not recommended on some colored bags. Please contact us for options or further details.\n\n<p class=\"color-chart-link\"></p>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"freight-estimator\" class=\"product-shipping no-print\"></div>\n\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][vc_custom_heading text=\"Shipping Drtails\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" el_class=\"hme-txt\"][vc_column_text]\n\n<table class=\"product-data-table-last\">\n\n<tbody>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Box Quantity:</td>\n\n<td>100</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Box Weight:</td>\n\n<td>8 lbs</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Box Dimensions:</td>\n\n<td>11W x\n\n11H x\n\n14</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody>\n\n</table>\n\n[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text]Package dimensions are for the quantity and weight outlined above. Other dimensions for broken-box quantities may apply.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][/vc_section]",
