    "shortDescription": "<table class=\"product-price-table\">\n\n<thead>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Item #</td>\n\n<td>100-299</td>\n\n<td>300-499</td>\n\n<td>500-999</td>\n\n<td>1000-2999</td>\n\n<td>3000</td>\n\n<td>Code</td>\n\n<td><span class=\"bold\">USD$</span>\n\n<img id=\"currency-flag\" src=\"https://areusablebag.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/US_square.png\" alt=\"US Pricing\" /></td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</thead>\n\n<tbody>\n\n<tr class=\"pricing-row\">\n\n<td class=\"price-catalog-id\">LL12815</td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$<span data-qty=\"150\" data-price=\"5.60\">3.050</span></td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$<span data-qty=\"250\" data-price=\"5.05\">2.750</span></td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$<span data-qty=\"500\" data-price=\"4.95\">2.600</span></td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$<span data-qty=\"1000\" data-price=\"4.85\">2.500</span></td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$<span data-qty=\"3000\" data-price=\"4.75\">2.300</span></td>\n\n<td>5C</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody>\n\n</table>\n\nPricing is per bag with 1 Color / 1 Side - Screen Print. - Insert Included.\n\nSee IMPRINT DETAILS for set-up charges.\n\nPrices are subject to change due to fluctuating tariffs.\n\nProduction is 5 business days after all credit and art approvals.\n\n**Total impressions over 3000 will require additional production time.**\n\n<div class=\"tabs\">\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Description</h4>\n\n<span class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">This durable tote bag measures 12\" x 15\" and features 8\" gussets with 16\" black web handles. Constructed out of a non-woven, matte laminated polypropylene material that is easy to wipe clean while providing additional structure and strength. This bag features contoured, curved corners and black gussets &amp; trim</span>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">FURTHER DESCRIPTION</h4>\n\n<span class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">NEW COLORS! Yellow and Navy bag colors!!</span>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Product Details</h4>\n\n<div class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nMaterial: </label><div class=\"span-text\">125 GSM Non-woven polypropylene with matte lamination - Recyclable # 5.</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nSize: </label><div class=\"span-text\">12\" W x 8” Gussets x 15” H</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nHandle Style: </label><div class=\"span-text\">16\" web handles</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCase Pack: </label><div class=\"span-text\">100</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCase Weight: </label><div class=\"span-text\">19 lbs</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nAvailable Colors: </label><div class=\"span-text\">White with Black handles &amp; trim, Lime Green with Black handles &amp; trim, Royal Blue with Black handles &amp; trim, Red with Black handles &amp; trim, Black with Black handles &amp; trim, Teal with Black handles &amp; trim, Purple with Black handles &amp; trim, Yellow with Black handles &amp; trim, Navy with Black handles &amp; trim</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nMaterial Thickness: </label><div class=\"span-text\">125 GSM (grams per square meter)</div></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Imprint Details</h4>\n\n<div class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nMax Artwork Size: </label><div class=\"span-text\">8” W x 7” H</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nProduction Time: </label><div class=\"span-text\"><span><strong>5 working days.</strong> Production begins after all credit and art proof approvals have been completed.\n\n**Orders with more than 3000 total impressions will require additional production time.**</span></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nPrint Location Options: </label><div class=\"span-text\">Front, Back</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nSet-up Charge: </label><div class=\"span-text\">$60.00 (G) per color, location, bag size and/or design.\n\nReorders $40.00 (G) per color, location, bag size and/or design.</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nAdditional Run Charges For Front Or Back: </label><div class=\"span-text\">1st color/1st location Run charge - FREE.\n\nRun charge: $0.60 (C) per additional color/location.\n\nUp to 2 spot colors per side.</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nSpecial Requests: </label><div class=\"span-text\">PMS Matching - $90 (E) per color\n\nCall to confirm color availability</div></div>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n\n<h4 class=\"content-head\">Shipping Details</h4>\n\n<div class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCarton Weight (Lbs): </label><div class=\"span-text\">19</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCarton Width: </label><div class=\"span-text\">15</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCarton Height: </label><div class=\"span-text\">16</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nCarton Length: </label><div class=\"span-text\">18</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"divInnerDetiles\"><label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\">\n\nUnits Per Carton: </label><div class=\"span-text\">100</div></div>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>",
