    "shortDescription": "<div class=\"pricingsection\">\n\n<div class=\"divclom9\">\n\n<div class=\"pricetable\">\n\n<table class=\"price_chart\">\n\n<tbody>\n\n<tr>\n\n<th class=\"bold\"></th>\n\n<th>100-299</th>\n\n<th>300-499</th>\n\n<th>500-999</th>\n\n<th>1000-2999</th>\n\n<th>3000</th>\n\n<th>Code</th>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td class=\"bold\">Screen Print Retail Price</td>\n\n<td>$3.100</td>\n\n<td>$2.900</td>\n\n<td>$2.650</td>\n\n<td>$2.550</td>\n\n<td>$2.450</td>\n\n<td>(5C)</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody>\n\n</table>\n\n<div class=\"priceNOte\">Pricing is per bag with 1 Color / 1 Side - Screen Print.\n\nSee IMPRINT DETAILS for set-up charges.\n\nPrices are subject to change due to fluctuating tariffs.\n\n<strong> Production is 5 business days after all credit and art approvals.</strong>**Total impressions over 3000 will require additional production time.**\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"tabs\">\n\n  <div class=\"content-box\">\n\n    <h4 class=\"content-head\">Description</h4>\n\n    <span class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">This durable grocery bag measures 16\" x 12\" and features 6\" gussets with 22\" handles. Crafted out of a non-woven, laminated polypropylene material that is easy to wipe clean while providing additional structure and strength. Designed to resist water, tears, and UV rays. Includes a high-gloss finish for a fashion-forward style. Available with a poly board insert. This bag may be customized with a company name and logo.</span>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content-box\">\n\n    <h4 class=\"content-head\">Further Description</h4>\n\n    <span class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">This bag is available with a poly board insert for the bottom of the bag at an additional cost of $0.70 (C) per bag. The insert is made out of clear plastic. Please order separately and we will slip one in each bag for you. You’ll need to add 8 lbs.per 100 bags to the case weight if ordering inserts.</span>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content-box\">\n\n    <h4 class=\"content-head\">Product Details</h4>\n\n    <div class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Material: </label>\n\n        <div class=\"span-text\">110 GSM Non-woven polypropylene with gloss lamination - Recyclable # 5.</div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Size: </label>\n\n        <div class=\"span-text\">16\" W x 6” Gussets x 12” H</div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Handle Style: </label>\n\n        <div class=\"span-text\">22\" matching non-woven</div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Case Pack: </label>\n\n        <div class=\"span-text\">100</div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Case Weight: </label>\n\n        <div class=\"span-text\">17 lbs</div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Available Colors: </label>\n\n        <div class=\"span-text\">White, Lime Green, Royal Blue, Navy Blue, Black, Purple, Pink</div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Material Thickness: </label>\n\n        <div class=\"span-text\">110 GSM (grams per square meter)</div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content-box\">\n\n    <h4 class=\"content-head\">Imprint Details</h4>\n\n    <div class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Max Artwork Size: </label>\n\n        <div class=\"span-text\">10” W x 8” H</div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Max Gusset Artwork Size: </label>\n\n        <div class=\"span-text\">3\" W x 7\" H</div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Production Time: </label>\n\n        <div class=\"span-text\">\n\n          <strong>5 working days.</strong> Production begins after all credit and art proof approvals have been completed. **Orders with more than 3000 total impressions will require additional production time.**\n\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Print Location Options: </label>\n\n        <div class=\"span-text\">Front, Back, Gusset 1, Gusset 2</div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Set-up Charge: </label>\n\n        <div class=\"span-text\">$60.00 (G) per color, location, bag size and/or design. Reorders $40.00 (G) per color, location, bag size and/or design.</div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Additional Run Charges For Front Or Back: </label>\n\n        <div class=\"span-text\">1st color/1st location Run charge - FREE. Run charge: $0.60 (C) per additional color/location. Up to 2 spot colors per side.</div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Additional Run Charges For Gusset: </label>\n\n        <div class=\"span-text\">$0.60 (C) per gusset. Maximum 1 spot color per gusset.</div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Special Requests: </label>\n\n        <div class=\"span-text\">PMS Matching - $90 (E) per color Call to confirm color availability</div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content-box\">\n\n    <h4 class=\"content-head\">Shipping Details</h4>\n\n    <div class=\"content-text\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Carton Weight (Lbs): </label>\n\n        <div class=\"span-text\">17</div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Carton Width: </label>\n\n        <div class=\"span-text\">19</div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Carton Height: </label>\n\n        <div class=\"span-text\">15</div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Carton Length: </label>\n\n        <div class=\"span-text\">23</div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"divInnerDetiles\">\n\n        <label class=\"ProductDetailGroupTitle\"> Units Per Carton: </label>\n\n        <div class=\"span-text\">100</div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</div>",
