    "description": "[vc_section el_class=\"pro-1\"][vc_row el_class=\"row-2\"][vc_column][vc_column_text]\n\n<div class=\"buttons\">\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li><i class=\"fas fa-play\"></i><a id=\"rq-popup-btn\" href=\"#\">Request Quote</a></li>\n\n \t<li><i class=\"fas fa-play\"></i><a id=\"os-popup-btn\" href=\"#\">Order Sample</a></li>\n\n</ul>\n\n</div>\n\n[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text]\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">\n\n<div class=\"product-desc\">The Picasso Tote has sturdy white 230-T polyester front and back panels accented by black gussets and handles. Choose from multiple imprint options, or combine processes for an eye-catching look!</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text]\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Also Available With These Imprints</h3>\n\n[/vc_column_text][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/6\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/6\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/6\"][vc_single_image image=\"4198\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/6\"][vc_single_image image=\"4199\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/6\"][vc_single_image image=\"4200\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/6\"][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column width=\"1/2\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Imprint Areas\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\"][vc_column_text]\n\n<table class=\"product-data-table\">\n\n<tbody>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Side Gusset</td>\n\n<td>4W x 8H</td>\n\n<td></td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Front and Back</td>\n\n<td>10W x 9H</td>\n\n<td></td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody>\n\n</table>\n\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/2\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Additional Charges\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\"][vc_column_text]\n\n<table class=\"product-data-table\">\n\n<tbody>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Set-Up</td>\n\n<td>No Set-Up Charge</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Reorder Set-Up</td>\n\n<td>No Set-Up Charge</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Additional Location</td>\n\n<td>$1.00 per bag, per location (G).</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Additional Color</td>\n\n<td>N/A</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Optional Plastic Bottom Insert</td>\n\n<td>$.30 per insert (C).</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody>\n\n</table>\n\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column width=\"1/2\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Production Time\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\"][vc_column_text]\n\n<table class=\"product-data-table\">\n\n<tbody>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>New Orders</td>\n\n<td>6 business days after all final approvals</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Reorders</td>\n\n<td>6 business days after all final approvals</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Rush Orders</td>\n\n<td></td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody>\n\n</table>\n\n[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text]<strong>*Note:</strong> Orders with more than 3,000 impressions will require extra production time.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/2\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Shipping Details\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" el_class=\"hme-txt\"][vc_column_text]\n\n<table class=\"product-data-table-last\">\n\n<tbody>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Box Quantity:</td>\n\n<td>100</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Box Weight:</td>\n\n<td>14 lbs</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Box Dimensions:</td>\n\n<td>17W x 24H x 6</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody>\n\n</table>\n\n[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text]Package dimensions are for the quantity and weight outlined above. Other dimensions for broken-box quantities may apply.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][/vc_section]",
