    "description": "[vc_section el_class=\"pro-1\"][vc_row el_class=\"row-2\"][vc_column][vc_column_text]\n\n<div class=\"buttons\">\n\n<ul>\n\n \t<li><i class=\"fas fa-play\"></i><a id=\"rq-popup-btn\" href=\"#\">Request Quote</a></li>\n\n \t<li><i class=\"fas fa-play\"></i><a id=\"os-popup-btn\" href=\"#\">Order Sample</a></li>\n\n</ul>\n\n</div>\n\n[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text]A perennial bestseller thanks to its affordability and multi-use functionality. This 80 GSM premium non-woven polypropylene tote features stitched seams, side and bottom gussets, and 28\" reinforced sewn handles. Optional plastic bottom insert available.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text]\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Also Available With These Imprints</h3>\n\n[/vc_column_text][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/6\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/6\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/6\"][vc_single_image image=\"3536\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/6\"][vc_single_image image=\"5469\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/6\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/6\"][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row disable_element=\"yes\" el_class=\"row-1\"][vc_column][vc_btn title=\"Freight Estimator\" el_class=\"btn-1\"][vc_btn title=\"Catalog Page\" el_class=\"btn-1\"][vc_btn title=\"Art Specs\" el_class=\"btn-1\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column width=\"1/2\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Imprint Areas\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\"][vc_column_text]\n\n<table class=\"product-data-table\">\n\n<tbody>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Side Gusset</td>\n\n<td>3W x 8H</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Front and Back</td>\n\n<td>14W x 10H</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody>\n\n</table>\n\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/2\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Additional Charges\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\"][vc_column_text]\n\n<table class=\"product-data-table\">\n\n<tbody>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Set-Up</td>\n\n<td>$55.00 per design. Up to 6 colors (G).</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Reorder Set-Up</td>\n\n<td>$35.00 per design. Up to 6 colors (G).</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Additional Location</td>\n\n<td>$2.00 per bag, per location (G).</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Optional Plastic Bottom Insert</td>\n\n<td>$0.30 per insert (C).</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody>\n\n</table>\n\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column width=\"1/2\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Production Time\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\"][vc_column_text]\n\n<table class=\"product-data-table\">\n\n<tbody>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>New Orders</td>\n\n<td>10 business days after all final approvals</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Reorders</td>\n\n<td>10 business days after all final approvals</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Rush Orders</td>\n\n<td>No rush available on SPARKLE imprinting</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody>\n\n</table>\n\n[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text]<strong>*Note:</strong> Orders with more than 3,000 impressions will require extra production time.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/2\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Shipping Details\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" el_class=\"hme-txt\"][vc_column_text]\n\n<table class=\"product-data-table-last\">\n\n<tbody>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Box Quantity:</td>\n\n<td>100</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Box Weight:</td>\n\n<td>19 lbs</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Box Dimensions:</td>\n\n<td>18W x 22H x 13</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody>\n\n</table>\n\n[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text]Package dimensions are for the quantity and weight outlined above. Other dimensions for broken-box quantities may apply.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row disable_element=\"yes\"][vc_column][vc_single_image image=\"643\" img_size=\"full\" alignment=\"center\" el_class=\"log-1\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][/vc_section]",
