    "shortDescription": "<table class=\"product-price-table\"><caption><img class=\"imprint-image\" src=\"https://areusablebag.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/screen_imprint_icon-1.png\" /></caption>\n\n<thead></thead>\n\n<thead>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Item #</td>\n\n<td>150</td>\n\n<td>250</td>\n\n<td>500</td>\n\n<td>1000</td>\n\n<td>3000</td>\n\n<td><span class=\"bold\">USD$</span>\n\n<img id=\"currency-flag\" src=\"https://areusablebag.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/US_square.png\" alt=\"US Pricing\" /></td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr class=\"pricing-row\">\n\n<td class=\"price-catalog-id\">39US1213</td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$<span data-qty=\"150\" data-price=\"3.45\">3.45</span></td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$<span data-qty=\"250\" data-price=\"2.85\">2.85</span></td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$<span data-qty=\"500\" data-price=\"2.70\">2.70</span></td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$<span data-qty=\"1000\" data-price=\"2.60\">2.60</span></td>\n\n<td class=\"price\">$<span data-qty=\"3000\" data-price=\"2.50\">2.50</span></td>\n\n<td>C</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</thead>\n\n</table>\n\nColumn price is per item, and includes a 1 color/1 side screen imprint. Screen charges are additional.",
    "description": "[vc_section el_class=\"pro-1\"][vc_row el_class=\"row-2\"][vc_column][vc_column_text]Need affordable non-woven bags without overseas transit times? This new non-woven series is proudly made and stocked in the USA. These high-quality bags are available in three sizes–Glory (80 GSM), Liberty (80 GSM), and Patriot (100 GSM). Choose from five bag colors and multiple imprint options.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text]\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Also Available With These Imprints</h3>\n\n[/vc_column_text][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/6\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/6\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/6\"][vc_single_image image=\"4326\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/6\"][vc_single_image image=\"4513\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/6\"][vc_single_image image=\"3535\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/6\"][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column width=\"1/2\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Imprint Areas\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\"][vc_column_text]\n\n<table class=\"product-data-table\">\n\n<tbody>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Front and Back</td>\n\n<td>7W x 8H</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody>\n\n</table>\n\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/2\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Additional Charges\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\"][vc_column_text]\n\n<table class=\"product-data-table\">\n\n<tbody>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Set-Up</td>\n\n<td>$55.00 per color, per design (G).</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Reorder Set-Up</td>\n\n<td>$35.00 per color, per design (G).</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Additional Location</td>\n\n<td>$0.50 per bag, per location (G).</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Additional Color</td>\n\n<td>$0.50 per color, per side, per bag (G).</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Bottom Insert</td>\n\n<td>$0.70 per insert (C).</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody>\n\n</table>\n\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column width=\"1/2\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Production Time\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\"][vc_column_text]\n\n<table class=\"product-data-table\">\n\n<tbody>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>New Orders</td>\n\n<td>4 business days after all final approvals</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Reorders</td>\n\n<td>3 business days after all final approvals</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Rush Orders</td>\n\n<td></td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody>\n\n</table>\n\n[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text]<strong>*Note:</strong> Orders with more than 3,000 impressions will require extra production time.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/2\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Imprint Colors\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\"][vc_column_text]<strong>Please note: Pantone® (PMS) color match is not available.</strong>\n\n\n\nColor tints/shades/tones may fluctuate up to 5% within a print run or reorder. Colors printed on a colored bag will result in a different tint, shade, or tone. Some screen ink colors are not recommended on some colored bags. Please contact us for options or further details.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][vc_custom_heading text=\"Shipping Details\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" el_class=\"hme-txt\"][vc_column_text]\n\n<table class=\"product-data-table-last\">\n\n<tbody>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Box Quantity:</td>\n\n<td>100</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Box Weight:</td>\n\n<td>12 lbs</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>Box Dimensions:</td>\n\n<td>12W x 17H x 13</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody>\n\n</table>\n\n[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text]Package dimensions are for the quantity and weight outlined above. Other dimensions for broken-box quantities may apply.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][/vc_section]",
